sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant NextJS as Next.js App
    participant BetterAuth as Better-Auth
    participant Databricks as Databricks Account
    participant Postgres as Postgres Database

    User->>NextJS: Click "Login with Databricks Account"
    NextJS->>BetterAuth: Initiate OAuth Flow

    Note over BetterAuth: Generate state & code_verifier<br/>(PKCE flow)

    BetterAuth->>NextJS: Store state in cookie
    NextJS->>User: Redirect to Databricks

    User->>Databricks: Databricks Login Page
    User->>Databricks: Enter Credentials
    Databricks->>Databricks: Authenticate User

    Databricks->>User: Redirect with auth code
    User->>NextJS: Callback with code & state

    NextJS->>BetterAuth: Handle callback
    BetterAuth->>BetterAuth: Verify state matches

    BetterAuth->>Databricks: Exchange code for tokens<br/>(with code_verifier)
    Databricks->>BetterAuth: Return access_token,<br/>refresh_token, expires_in

    BetterAuth->>Databricks: Fetch user profile<br/>(using access_token)
    Databricks->>BetterAuth: Return user data<br/>(email, name, account_id)

    BetterAuth->>Postgres: Upsert User record
    Postgres-->>BetterAuth: User ID

    BetterAuth->>Postgres: Create/Update Account record<br/>(provider: databricks-account)
    Postgres-->>BetterAuth: Account ID

    BetterAuth->>Postgres: Store encrypted tokens<br/>in OAuth_Token table
    Note over Postgres: Tokens encrypted at rest<br/>using AES-256-GCM

    BetterAuth->>Postgres: Create Session record
    Note over Postgres: Session contains:<br/>- userId<br/>- sessionToken (random)<br/>- expiresAt<br/>- ipAddress & userAgent

    Postgres-->>BetterAuth: Session created

    BetterAuth->>NextJS: Set session cookie<br/>(better-auth.session_token)
    Note over NextJS: Cookie is:<br/>- HttpOnly<br/>- Secure<br/>- SameSite=Lax<br/>- 30 day expiry

    NextJS->>User: Redirect to dashboard

    User->>NextJS: Access Dashboard
    NextJS->>BetterAuth: Verify session token
    BetterAuth->>Postgres: Query session by token
    Postgres-->>BetterAuth: Session data + User data

    BetterAuth->>NextJS: User authenticated<br/>(has Account Admin access)
    NextJS->>User: Show Dashboard
